---
config:
  sequence:
    diagramMarginX: 10
    diagramMarginY: 10
    actorMargin: 120
    width: 500
    height: 120
    boxMargin: 20
    messageMargin: 80
    noteMargin: 40
    noteAlign: "left"
    wrap: true
    wrapPadding: 20
    rightAngles: false
    showSequenceNumbers: false
    mirrorActors: false
  themeVariables:
    noteBkgColor: "#fffbf0"
    noteTextColor: "#333333"
    noteBorderColor: "#cccccc"
    noteTextSize: "14px"
  svg:
    useMaxWidth: true
    padding: 5
  cssRules: ".note { min-width: 400px !important; }"
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant dev as Developer
    participant owner as Code Owner
    participant external_repo as Application Repo<br/>(Ex: Any Application Repo)
    participant automation_repo as Centralized Automation Repo<br/>(Repo that houses reusable workflows)
    participant reusable_workflow as Reusable Workflow
    participant build as Build Composite
    participant deploy as Deploy Composite
    participant dev_env as Dev Environment
    participant test_env as Test Environment
    participant staging_gate as Staging Approval Gate
    participant staging_env as Staging Environment
    participant prod_gate as Prod Approval Gate
    participant prod_env as Prod Environment

    %% Initial Development Flow
    dev->>+external_repo: User/Feature branch based off of Main is Published
    external_repo->>dev: GitHub Advanced Security runs Dependabot, CodeQL, and Secret Scanning
    dev->>external_repo: Submit Pull Request to merge User/Feature branch into Main
    external_repo->>owner: Request code review

    Note over external_repo: When a PR is created or updated, a series of<br/>pre-merge checks are executed, including those<br/>that verify Team configurations are correct<br/>and that admin rights have not been tampered with

    %% Pre-Merge Checks
    external_repo->>external_repo: Run Pre-Merge Checks: Branch Naming Rules,<br/>Environment Protection Rules, Core Branch Protections

    Note over external_repo: Protection rules:<br/>- Required reviewers (Optional, with a designated<br/>  approvers team)<br/>- No bypass allowances<br/>- Administrator bypass disabled<br/>- Workflow failure if tests fail

    %% Workflow Triggering
    external_repo->>external_repo: Trigger Reusable Workflow via Calling Workflow Template<br/>in Application repository

    Note over external_repo: Workflow uses calling workflow that calls<br/>the reusable workflow housed in a<br/>Centralized Automation Repository

    external_repo->>+automation_repo: Calling Workflow in application repo uses reusable workflow<br/>in Centralized Automation Repository

    Note over external_repo, automation_repo: Within each application repository there will be a calling workflow that<br/>triggers reusable workflow logic from the workflow housed in<br/>the Centralized Automation Repository

    automation_repo->>+reusable_workflow: Execute reusable workflow
    reusable_workflow->>+build: Execute build composite

    %% Build Process Section
    rect rgba(9, 30, 51, 1)
    Note over build: Build Process (15 Steps)
    build->>build: 1. Install Build Tools
    build->>build: 2-3. Prepare & Run SCA Scan (∗)
    build->>build: 4. Generate SBOM (∗)
    build->>build: 5-6. Publish SCA Results & Enforce Policy (∗)
    build->>build: 7-8. Prepare & Run SAST Scan (∗)
    build->>build: 9-11. Generate SARIF, Publish SAST Results & Enforce Policy (∗)
    Note over build, deploy: Note: Steps denoted with an asterisk (∗)<br/>represent the flow for legacy security applications
    build->>build: 12. Restore Dependencies
    build->>build: 13. Build Application
    build->>build: 14-15. Run Unit Tests & Publish Results
    build->>build: Post-Build: Validation & Manifest Generation
    end

    build->>+deploy: Pass build artifacts & security reports
    build->>-deploy: Deploy: Execute deploy composite

    %% Dev Environment Deployment
    rect rgba(161, 106, 2, 1)
    Note over deploy: Dev Environment Deployment
    deploy->>deploy: 1. Validate Deployment Prerequisites
    deploy->>deploy: 2. Create Application Backup
    deploy->>+dev_env: 3. Prepare Deployment Environment
    deploy->>dev_env: 4. Deploy Application to IIS via SSH
    deploy->>dev_env: 5. Start Application
    deploy->>dev_env: 6. Verify Deployment
    deploy->>dev_env: 7. Run Smoke Tests
    deploy->>dev_env: 8. Warm up Application
    deploy->>dev_env: 9. Run Health Checks
    deploy->>dev_env: 10. Update Deployment Status
    deploy->>dev_env: 11. Post-Deployment Cleanup
    dev_env->>-deploy: Dev deployment complete
    end

    reusable_workflow->>automation_repo: Update deployment status & generate summary
    automation_repo->>-external_repo: Return workflow results

    Note over external_repo: Note: Notification of deployment completion<br/>can be sent to any designated stakeholders<br/>via email or other communication tools

    external_repo->>dev: Notify completion status
    owner->>external_repo: Review and approve pull request
    external_repo->>-external_repo: User/Feature Branch is merged into Main

    %% Test Environment Deployment
    rect rgba(95, 2, 33, 1)
    Note over deploy: Test Environment Deployment
    deploy->>+test_env: Deploy to Test automatically
    deploy->>test_env: Execute deployment process
    test_env->>-deploy: Test deployment complete
    end

    %% Staging Environment Deployment
    rect rgba(5, 84, 104, 1)
    Note over deploy: Staging Environment Deployment
    deploy->>+staging_gate: Request approval for Staging
    deploy->>deploy: Validate Application APART ID
    deploy->>deploy: Validate Target IPs
    staging_gate->>staging_gate: Wait for manual approval<br/>(Environment protection rules enforced)

    Note over staging_gate, staging_env: A designated approvers team for Staging reviews<br/>and approves the deployment

    staging_gate->>+staging_env: Deploy to Staging (after approval)
    deploy->>staging_env: Execute deployment process
    staging_env->>-deploy: Staging deployment complete
    staging_gate->>-staging_gate: Approval completed
    end

    %% Production Deployment
    rect rgba(46, 2, 63, 1)
    Note over deploy: Production Deployment
    deploy->>+prod_gate: Request approval for Production
    deploy->>deploy: Validate Application APART ID
    deploy->>deploy: Validate Target IPs
    prod_gate->>prod_gate: Wait for manual approval<br/>(Environment protection rules enforced)

    Note over prod_gate, prod_env: A designated approvers team for Production reviews<br/>and approves the deployment

    prod_gate->>prod_gate: Run Pre-Deploy Checks: Branch Naming Rules,<br/>Environment Protection Rules, Core Branch Protections
    prod_gate->>+prod_env: Deploy to Production (after approval)
    deploy->>prod_env: Execute deployment process
    prod_env->>-deploy: Production deployment complete
    prod_gate->>-prod_gate: Approval completed
    end

    deactivate deploy
    deactivate reusable_workflow